Collegiate mental health is frequently addressed only reactively after severe distress.

8
00:00:29,604 --> 00:00:34,008
However, well-being is intricately connected to daily lifestyle patterns like screen

9
00:00:34,008 --> 00:00:38,412
time, sleep quality, and support systems. Our objective is building an

10
00:00:38,412 --> 00:00:42,816
