13
00:00:51,624 --> 00:00:57,036
Our verified dataset contains exactly 200 student records across 18 multi-dimensional

14
00:00:57,036 --> 00:01:02,448
behavioral, clinical, and academic variables, tracked from STU 0001 to STU

15
00:01:02,448 --> 00:01:07,860
0200. Demographics capture age 18 to 25 and gender cohorts. Clinical

16
00:01:07,860 --> 00:01:13,272
